    },
    "3. Bugly：用于崩溃监控，仅上报崩溃堆栈与匿名设备信息，不包含用户对话内容与个人身份信息。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Bugly: used for crash monitoring; only crash stacks and anonymous device info are reported, not conversation content or personal identity information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Bugly：用于崩溃监控，仅上报崩溃堆栈与匿名设备信息，不包含用户对话内容与个人身份信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Bugly：用於崩潰監控，僅上報崩潰堆疊與匿名裝置資訊，不包含用戶對話內容與個人身份資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 使用统计：包括性能埋点（如请求延迟、token 数）与崩溃日志，用于持续优化 App 体验。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Usage statistics: includes performance metrics (e.g. request latency, token count) and crash logs, used to continuously improve the app experience."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. 使用统计：包括性能埋点（如请求延迟、token 数）与崩溃日志，用于持续优化 App 体验。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. 使用統計：包括效能埋點（如請求延遲、token 數）與崩潰紀錄，用於持續最佳化 App 體驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 撤回 HealthKit 授权：可在「系统设置 - 隐私 - 健康」中撤回对 AI Builder 的授权。" : {
